---
import StatePage from '../../layouts/StatePage.astro';
---
<StatePage title="Privacy Policy — LienForm" description="LienForm privacy policy. How we collect, use, and protect your information." canonical="https://mechanicslienform.com/privacy-policy/">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose prose-lg">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <h2>1. What We Collect</h2>
    <p>When you use LienForm, we may collect the following information:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Form data you enter:</strong> Property address, owner name, contract amounts, dates, and other project details you type into the lien generator. This data is processed client-side in your browser to generate your PDF — it is not stored on our servers.</li>
      <li><strong>Contact form submissions:</strong> Name, email address, and message content when you contact us through the Contact page.</li>
      <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> Standard web server logs including IP address, browser type, pages visited, and time of access. This is collected automatically by our hosting provider (Vercel).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To provide and improve the LienForm service</li>
      <li>To respond to inquiries submitted through the contact form</li>
      <li>To diagnose technical issues and monitor service performance</li>
      <li>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. PDF Generation</h2>
    <p>All lien documents are generated entirely in your browser using client-side JavaScript (jsPDF). The project details you enter are not transmitted to or stored on LienForm servers. Your document data stays on your device.</p>

    <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
    <p>LienForm may use essential cookies required for the site to function. If analytics are added in the future, we will update this policy and provide opt-out options. We do not currently use advertising cookies.</p>

    <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Vercel:</strong> Our hosting provider. Vercel may collect standard access logs. See <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vercel's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Resend:</strong> Used to deliver contact form emails. Contact form data (name, email, message) is transmitted to Resend for delivery. See <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Resend's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>Contact form submissions are retained only as long as necessary to respond to your inquiry. Server access logs are retained per Vercel's standard policies.</p>

    <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You may request deletion of any personal data we hold about you by contacting us at <a href="mailto:amitsharma00261@gmail.com">amitsharma00261@gmail.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy as the service evolves. Material changes will be noted with an updated date above.</p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a> or email <a href="mailto:amitsharma00261@gmail.com">amitsharma00261@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</StatePage>
